            </div>

            <div class="p-6 md:p-10 bg-zinc-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Abandoned Funeral Home: Human Remains Found</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                    James uncovers the dark history of the Savagio Funeral Home. From legal scandals to actual remains left inside the building, this is one of JF Travels' most chilling urban explorations to date.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
