                        <i class="fab fa-youtube text-xl"></i> SUBSCRIBE ON YOUTUBE
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sSylxrcMZWw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-gray-200 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition">
