                    <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Step inside the decaying corridors of the historic Cresson Tuberculosis Sanatorium and later State Correctional Institution. Built in the early 1900s, thousands of patients and inmates passed through these eerie halls—and many never left.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8">
                        <span class="text-xs bg-black/60 border border-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-gray-400">#explore</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-black/60 border border-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-gray-400">#urbex</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-black/60 border border-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-gray-400">#paranormal</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-black/60 border border-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-gray-400">#shorts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                        <a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/U0-fpe3ePYk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-blood text-white px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs">
                            <i class="fab fa-youtube text-lg"></i> Watch Short on YouTube
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@jftravels412/shorts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-gray-200 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition">
                            View All Shorts
